Expected expression after

# ===========================================================================
# Accepted today, but wrong: the `colour` channel is dropped without an error
# (the spec has no color encoding). These wait for the colour alias (1a) and
# do not count as passing. They become `statement ok` blocks with a feature
# test of the channel when the alias lands.
#
# gallery/examples/density.qmd
#   VISUALISE bill_len AS x, species AS colour FROM penguins
#     DRAW density
# gallery/examples/violin.qmd
#   VISUALISE species AS x, bill_len AS y, island AS colour FROM penguins
#     DRAW violin
# gallery/examples/violin.qmd
#   VISUALISE species AS x, bill_len AS y, species AS colour FROM penguins
#     DRAW violin
